          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes SayLa’s daily affirmation app different?",
            "answer": "<p>Scan the QR code on your SayLa lip balm tube to unlock our app, which delivers short, powerful affirmations designed to be spoken out loud.</p><p>By combining a clean-beauty ritual with the proven impact of the spoken word, SayLa helps you not just read your truth but live it—bringing calm, confidence, and presence to every swipe.</p>",
